Crisp for macOS (universal: Apple Silicon and Intel), VST3

Crisp is made by Robbert van der Helm (https://github.com/robbert-vdh/nih-plug/tree/master/plugins/crisp), as part
of his NIH-plug project. Copyright (C) 2022-2024 Robbert van der Helm. It is free software under the GNU General
Public License, version 3 or later: see LICENSE.txt. It comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY.

This copy was built from Crisp's unchanged source by Sonic Weaponry, so that macOS opens it without security
warnings: Sonic Weaponry signed it with its Apple Developer ID and had Apple notarize it. Nothing about the plugin was
changed. Robbert van der Helm did not make, sign or endorse this build; questions about it go to Sonic Weaponry, not
to him.

